# Conversation Flow Examples

## Example 1 — Customer Support

Customer:

> I need help accessing my account.

AI Agent:

> I can help with that. Can you confirm the email associated with your account?

System Action:

- Verify email
- Retrieve account status
- Provide access instructions
- Log interaction

---

## Example 2 — Sales Qualification

Customer:

> I want to know what is included.

AI Agent:

> I can walk you through the main inclusions. Are you looking for product details, pricing, or access information?

System Action:

- Retrieve product knowledge
- Answer using approved knowledge base
- Ask one clarifying question

---

## Example 3 — Cancellation Request

Customer:

> I want to cancel my subscription.

AI Agent:

> I understand. Before I process that, can I confirm the email associated with your account?

System Action:

- Verify customer identity
- Lookup subscription
- Confirm action
- Trigger cancellation workflow
- Wait for tool success
- Confirm only after successful execution
